@moduledoc """
Feature flags, by FunWithFlags (https://hexdocs.pm/fun_with_flags).

Flags live in the database (`fun_with_flags_toggles`) and are managed by admins
at `/admin/flags`. This module tells FunWithFlags who the actors are:

  * a user is the actor `"user:<id>"`, an organization `"organization:<id>"`,
  * platform admins are in the `"admins"` group.

    FunWithFlags.enabled?(:new_dashboard, for: user)
    FunWithFlags.enabled?(:new_billing, for: organization)
    FunWithFlags.enable(:beta, for_group: "admins")
"""

defimpl FunWithFlags.Actor, for: <%= inspect(@user) %> do
  def id(%{id: id}), do: "user:" <> id
end

defimpl FunWithFlags.Actor, for: <%= inspect(@accounts) %>.Organization do
  def id(%{id: id}), do: "organization:" <> id
end

defimpl FunWithFlags.Group, for: <%= inspect(@user) %> do
  def in?(%{role: :admin}, "admins"), do: true
  def in?(_user, _group), do: false
end
